============================================================
PART 4: REFINE AGENT
============================================================

MAIN RESPONSIBILITY:

Use the critique feedback to improve the content.


============================================================
WHAT THE REFINE AGENT DOES
============================================================

1. ADDRESS GAPS

- Add missing information
- Expand incomplete sections
- Fill knowledge gaps
- Complete coverage


------------------------------------------------------------

2. ENHANCE CONTENT

- Improve clarity
- Improve organization
- Improve structure
- Improve flow


------------------------------------------------------------

3. IMPROVE QUALITY

- Add examples
- Improve explanations
- Strengthen arguments
- Improve presentation


============================================================
WHAT THE REFINE AGENT DOES NOT DO
============================================================

DOES NOT start completely new research.

DOES NOT re-evaluate its own quality.

DOES NOT make the final quality judgment.

DOES NOT independently loop back to Critique.

DOES NOT change the core findings.


============================================================
REFINEMENT STRATEGY
============================================================

GAP 1:

"Missing 2024 AI agent developments"


Refine Agent:

1. Use existing research

2. Add available 2024 developments

3. Integrate them into existing structure

4. Maintain consistency

5. Add citations


------------------------------------------------------------

GAP 2:

"No practical implementation examples"


Refine Agent:

1. Use existing research

2. Add 3-5 practical examples

3. Explain application

4. Include code snippets or diagrams

5. Connect examples to theory


------------------------------------------------------------

GAP 3:

"Edge cases not documented"


Refine Agent:

1. Use existing research

2. Identify edge cases from theory

3. Document the edge cases

4. Explain implications

5. Suggest handling strategies


